{"_id":"692824d2eb1c20e3a04f426a","title":"Ryzex Zombie HyperLoot Advanced Aimbot And ESP GUI","game":{"_id":"6910e034d5dfccf0dba68419","gameId":100822312246972,"name":"[❄🎅] Zombie: HyperLoot","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a343a379f4d30d6149d7b7c40a05b62ce8ce45cb17e5dac3f35a9b477fa687eb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2b82cd5ac736c385e56a32508a5d7f26/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"100822312246972-zombie-hyperloot","path":"/game/100822312246972-zombie-hyperloot","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a343a379f4d30d6149d7b7c40a05b62ce8ce45cb17e5dac3f35a9b477fa687eb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2b82cd5ac736c385e56a32508a5d7f26/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":100822312246972},"slug":"RAID-Zombie:-HyperLoot-Ryzex-Zombie-HyperLoot-Advanced-Aimbot-And-ESP-GUI-70532","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":3366,"executes":849,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/24ff8caa6effbd81672c0ac076c780594aa7468c095904d268a57d06fdee51b2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/100822312246972-1764238546136.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/100822312246972-1764238546136.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/24ff8caa6effbd81672c0ac076c780594aa7468c095904d268a57d06fdee51b2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/100822312246972-1764238546136.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/100822312246972-1764238546136.png"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":6,"createdAt":"2025-11-27T10:15:46.159Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-27T10:15:46.159Z","lastBump":"2025-11-27T10:15:46.159Z","script":"https://lootdest.org/s?feyGupCw\n\nkey:Ryzex1337","features":"Ｒ¥乙乇メ | [🦃RAID] Zombie: HyperLoot | Pro Aimbot + ESP\n\nScript complet pour [🦃RAID] Zombie: HyperLoot avec menu violet moderne et système de key intégré. Après la vérification de la key, tu obtiens un grand panel configurable avec ton avatar Roblox, ton pseudo et plusieurs pages (Home / Aimbot / ESP / Visuals / Divers). La touche **Insert** permet d’ouvrir / fermer le menu.\n\nFonctionnalités principales :\n\n* Aimbot configurable : ON/OFF, lock quand tu maintiens clic droit, team check, choix de l’aim part (Head / UpperTorso / HumanoidRootPart)\n* Sélection de la cible : uniquement Zombies (dossier **Entity**), uniquement Players, ou All (Players + Zombies)\n* FOV avancé : cercle FOV autour de la souris, FOV ON/OFF + slider pour régler le rayon\n* Smoothness et Prediction ajustables pour rendre le lock plus “legit” ou plus instantané\n* ESP complet sur les joueurs et les zombies :\n\n  * Boxes 2D propres\n  * Noms + HP affichés au-dessus\n  * Tracers depuis le bas de l’écran\n  * Barre de vie verticale colorée (du rouge au vert selon la vie)\n  * ESP qui se désactive automatiquement quand la cible meurt ou sort de l’écran\n* Onglet Visuals avec crosshair custom (toggle ON/OFF)\n* Onglet Divers avec rappel des touches et bouton “Unload script” pour retirer proprement le cheat\n\n\n\n\nＲ¥乙乇メ | [🦃RAID] Zombie: HyperLoot | Pro Aimbot + ESP\n\nFull script for [🦃RAID] Zombie: HyperLoot with a modern purple menu and built-in key system. After the key is verified, you get access to a big configurable panel with your Roblox avatar, username and several tabs (Home / Aimbot / ESP / Visuals / Misc). The **Insert** key opens/closes the menu.\n\nMain features:\n\n* Configurable Aimbot: ON/OFF, lock while holding right-click, team check, selectable aim part (Head / UpperTorso / HumanoidRootPart)\n* Target selection: Zombies only ( **Entity** folder), Players only, or All (Players + Zombies)\n* Advanced FOV: FOV circle around the mouse, FOV ON/OFF + slider to adjust radius\n* Adjustable Smoothness and Prediction to make the lock more “legit” or more instant\n* Full ESP for players and zombies:\n\n  * Clean 2D boxes\n  * Names + HP displayed above\n  * Tracers from the bottom of the screen\n  * Vertical health bar with color gradient (from red to green based on HP)\n  * ESP automatically disables when the target dies or leaves the screen\n* Visuals tab with custom crosshair (toggle ON/OFF)\n* Misc tab with keybind reminders and an “Unload script” button to cleanly remove the cheat","tags":["zombie","hyperloot","inf","op"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/DKd63QNSUV","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","username":"ryzex_7k","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/32750eb6ea495f2ad03f62708109e22086405bfddac8710815d100a2b1e798dc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3-1790951312868.png"},"status":"offline","id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/32750eb6ea495f2ad03f62708109e22086405bfddac8710815d100a2b1e798dc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3-1790951312868.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:52:57.640Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"692824d2eb1c20e3a04f426c","editBy":{"_id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","username":"ryzex_7k","status":"offline","id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-11-27T10:15:46.166Z"},{"_id":"6928257d0b3b5f2aad6d330f","editBy":{"_id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","username":"ryzex_7k","status":"offline","id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-11-27T10:18:37.681Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69282dc47c94f7b6979e1166","commentBy":{"_id":"6900f4a7e5a56b1618891432","username":"BoomVoyBoy","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2025-10-28T16:51:51.380Z","last